# The build context is an allow-list: only what `bun install` and the app builds read, so no .env, pilot/ or
# local build output reaches the image.
*
!package.json
!bun.lock
!apps/
!packages/
!scripts/container-entry.sh
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/dist
**/out
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
**/.env*
